  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Welcome, everybody. We're really excited\nabout this talk with Teresa Torres,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5940,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who was a student in our first cohort."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8540,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Teresa Torres is a legendary person in the\nproduct management space."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14620,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She has trained, I think, like over 70,000\npeople or something like that on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19580,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to do product management effectively."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24600,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She's the author of this book, Continuous\nDiscovery Habits, which is right behind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28540,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "her. You'll see it. You should definitely\ncheck that book out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31760,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very—it's like one of the canons in\nproduct management, from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37300,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "my understanding. I'm not a product\nmanager myself, but every product manager"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39840,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tells me that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41760,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason this talk is so exciting and\nthe reason why you should pay attention to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45040,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this is, hey, like Teresa, she's not\ncoding every day or anything like that and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50580,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wasn't, like, necessarily doing evals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53220,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "She had her own approach combined with her\nproduct management expertise, and she has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58720,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a unique take on how she went about things\nand has found a workflow that she likes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64340,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And she's going to share that today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65820,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm going to hand it off to Teresa to\nget us started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70280,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right. I'm really excited to do this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73340,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I really enjoyed this class quite a bit,\nand you're going to see I learned a ton"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78440,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and was able to put a lot of it into\npractice right away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81420,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I cannot emphasize this enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85260,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I forget when the first cohort started."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86960,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it was in June, maybe May. I\nbarely knew what an eval was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91500,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, and we'll talk about that in my\ntalk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94760,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to share some slides, but I'm\nhappy to keep this very conversational."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99120,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So please feel free to jump in, Hamel or\nShreya, with questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105160,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll just dig in. I'm going to start by\ngiving a little bit of context about the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110160,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product that I'm building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113300,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Camel mentioned some of this in my\nintro, so I'll touch on this briefly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116780,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, my day job, I work as a product\ndiscovery coach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120520,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It means I help product teams make better\ndecisions about what to build."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124660,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of you I know are familiar with my\nbook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127640,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have a wide variety of courses. In\nfact, I saw Letty is here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130780,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Letty is currently in our continuous\ninterviewing course and has gotten to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134640,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experience the continuous interview coach\nfirsthand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138300,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But basically, because I primarily am an\neducator,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142260,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I started to think about generative\nAI and how it might impact what I do, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147320,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was thinking about it from a teaching\nstandpoint."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150140,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's the part that's relevant here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151980,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I found myself in March, I actually had\nto have ankle surgery,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157960,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was like on the couch for months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160480,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, how in the world am I\ngoing to use my time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163420,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I started with this question of what\ndoes generative AI make just now possible?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168140,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was asking this in the context of\nour courses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170640,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there was one course in particular I\nthought this would help a lot with, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174540,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is our continuous interviewing course."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176300,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this course, students learn how—this\nis customer interviews, so not job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181500,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interviews—and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182780,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this course, students learn how to ask\nthe right questions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186440,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They practice active listening techniques."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189140,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We teach a very specific type of customer\ninterview where they're asking the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194300,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customer to share a specific story about\ntheir past behavior."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198000,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's reasons for this. This is a\nway to collect reliable feedback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202080,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm a little bit of like a research\nmethods wonk, so I'm like trying to look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206020,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at what's the easiest way to teach product\nteams who are not researchers effective"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211700,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ways to get customer feedback. And in all\nof our classes, they're very practice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215820,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oriented."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217300,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like in this class, students come to\nclass and they interview each other, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222200,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we give them a rubric to help give each\nother feedback, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225440,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm a big fan of deliberate practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227320,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We practice a skill, we get feedback, we\nthen know exactly what to practice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232080,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's one challenge, though. Like when\nstudents give each other feedback, they're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234980,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not really experts, so they don't give\nexpert feedback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238160,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so the problem I was looking to solve\nwas like, can we help students give each"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241600,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other better feedback on their practice\ninterviews?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244300,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that led to this question of, can we\nmodel what good feedback looks like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248860,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so this is the tool that I built."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250700,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I built an interview coach where students\nsubmit their interview transcripts and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254920,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get very detailed feedback on what\ntheir—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259280,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how they did on conducting an interview."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262080,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the coach actually— this is actually\nwhat you get from the coach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266580,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the coach, this is actually a partial\nresponse, but the coach is basically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270940,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluating the interview transcript on\nfour different dimensions, and this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274820,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the rubric that we teach in the\nclass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277400,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we're evaluating: did they ask a\nstory-based question?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280940,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did they ask the participant to set the\nscene?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283280,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the two that you're seeing here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284940,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's also a dimension about building\nthe timeline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287660,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How well did they get the participant to\ntell their story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then did they do a good job of\nredirecting generalizations?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294360,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can— I'm going to dive into this a\nlittle bit because a lot of my evals are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297500,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about this coach feedback, so this will\ngive you some context."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300540,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can see here for each dimension,\nthey're getting a score."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303760,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The score can be keep practicing, getting\nit, or great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 308600,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This coach is pulling out real excerpts\nfrom the interview transcript and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313260,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving them a tip. So this might be, this\nwas really good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316820,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It might be, here's some room for\nimprovement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319580,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's doing this across all four\ndimensions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 322140,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's two sections of this email\nwe're not seeing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325400,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's basically excerpt, tip, excerpt,\ntip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328540,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so that's the interview coach."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331800,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's get into..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333800,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We need the dimensions. Is it that those,\nis it like different stages, opening with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338060,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the story-based question and setting the\nscene?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340100,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are those the dimensions? Yeah. It's, so\nwhat we're looking for in the transcript"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344320,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is, did they ask the participant to share\na story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347680,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We teach that they should ask them to set\nthe scene because this helps with memory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351220,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "recall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 353180,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's a cognitive tip"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355940,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to help get a more reliable story. And\nthen the building the timeline dimension"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360120,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is, did they help the participant go step\nby step through their story so they're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 364580,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learning what actually happened? And then\nthe last dimension is, if I ask you, tell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370060,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "me about the last time you watched\nNetflix, you might start to generalize"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373600,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about what you usually do on Netflix."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375320,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so my job as the interviewer is to\nredirect you back to the specifics of your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380940,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "story. And so that's the fourth dimension\nthat we're evaluating on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384740,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Interesting. Yeah. I need to read the book\ntoo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390020,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is also, this is already very\ninteresting to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392680,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Awesome. Okay. So as I was building the\ninterview coach, I literally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398500,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was like vibe checking the coach's\nresponses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401960,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of them looked good, some of them had\nsome problems, and I started to get"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406200,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "concerned, like, how do I know if my\ninterview coach is any good?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409160,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would make like... So what did you have\nin the interview coach?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412240,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it like transcript of your book?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415700,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What information, like, was your initial\nversion?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418660,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes. So because we have a course on this\ntopic, I already had a rubric for how to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424640,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluate an interview. And so I started\nwith the rubric that we use in the class,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 428660,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I included a lot of the\ninstructional content that we provide to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433300,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "students in the class to the LLM. And,\nlike, my very first prototype was in a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437980,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Claude project. I just uploaded a bunch of\nfiles to Claude, and I was just like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441580,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's an interview transcript. Give me\nfeedback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443900,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It obviously has iterated and evolved\nquite a bit from there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447960,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But basically, the coach, the AI tool, the\ncoach gets a full interview transcript,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 453540,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it has a lot of context about\nwhat's a good interview, what these four"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459180,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dimensions are. It started as one prompt."
    } ]
