  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2346420,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're not just, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2348140,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "letting it—you're actually, like, grooming\nthis very carefully."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352600,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's a great way to put it, and I\nthink that's really important to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2357620,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I gave this talk yesterday, and I realized\neverybody thought I was just vibe coding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2361540,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was like, oh, I need to distinguish\nthis because I don't want to send people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364260,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off to just create a notebook. If I let\nClaude just create this on its own, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2368720,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the data analysis would be wrong,\nespecially if it was Sonnet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2371840,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, Sonnet is sloppy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2374700,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, Andrew Karpathy, in his\nSoftware 3.0 talk, had a really great line"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2380040,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that resonated with me, which was, I\noptimize for four-line diffs, not a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2383880,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousand-line diffs. And that, like,\nencapsulates perfectly how I work with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2388680,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Claude Code. Because I'm really terrified\nof ending up with a product that I can't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2393300,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maintain myself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2395460,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so the other thing that has changed,\nI now had Claude Code build me a custom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2400040,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "annotation tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2402120,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see here it follows everything you\nlearned in this class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2404860,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I got a progress bar at the top. This is\nmy trace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2408780,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really nicely color coded and, like,\nvisual for helping me understand, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2412360,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what section I'm in. I've got an\nannotation box."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2415260,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've got failure modes. I've got next and\nback."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2417640,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everything is key coded so I can do fast\nkeyboard shortcuts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2422420,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I actually have about half a dozen custom\nannotation tools, and because sometimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2428300,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm annotating the whole trace, sometimes\nI'm annotating a single question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2432400,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I'm, like, loading a whole bunch of\nquestions into the tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2435740,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just any time I'm working on an eval\nand, like, my annotation needs change, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2440740,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "literally just have Claude Code. Like, I\ntell it, I like the interface from this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2444360,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "annotation tool, but now I have new input\nor a new output format."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2448260,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just spin up another tool. And it does it\nin two minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2452260,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, it's just so fast. So these I vibe\ncode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2455000,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can't even tell you how this is\nimplemented."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2457700,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just test the inputs and the outputs and\nmake sure that it's working."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2462800,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then here's the thing that's really\nexciting to me, is that I started this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2466580,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "project trying to create a teaching tool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2470380,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I was using it in my classes. And,\nlike, my classes are cohorts of 20 to 50"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2474780,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "students. It's not high volume. If\nsomething went wrong, I would get an email"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2478400,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I would just rerun it. But over the\ncourse of this project, I started talking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2482680,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to this company, Vistaly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2484720,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vistaly is a software product for product\ndiscovery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2489580,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They have a whole flow for customer\ninterviews and helping you synthesize your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2493520,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customer interviews and create opportunity\nsolution trees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2496820,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And actually, we're in the process of\nrolling out the interview coach as a beta"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2500140,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feature inside Vistaly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2502440,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what's crazy to me about this, I'm\ngoing to tell you, two weeks ago I had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2507080,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never worked in a IDE."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2508860,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Two weeks ago, I never had a dev\nenvironment and a prod environment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2512180,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And suddenly, like, I have to make\nproduction quality code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2516080,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for the last two weeks, I've been\nworking nonstop, like learning how to be a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2519660,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "real software engineer. I've been working\nwith Opus and O3 on, okay, walk me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2525580,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through error handling, beat this up, like\nwhere is it going to fail?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2529020,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm now pretty confident that I have a\npretty good production product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2532860,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We are rolling out to beta customers this\nweek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2535360,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll see how it goes, but I'm crossing my\nfingers that I've got a real AI app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2539660,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's doing pretty darn well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2543640,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is amazing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2546760,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a product person, designer, kind of\nhalf-baked engineer, it feels really good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2552540,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to release, like, a real product where I\nliterally did every part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2557020,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very empowering, and I could not have\ndone it without LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2561120,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This might be the best evaled product in\nproduction that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2567000,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have seen. Like, from now on, when\nsomeone asks me, hey, like, what's a good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2570660,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "example of a really good eval, like a\nproduct in production, this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576540,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it. There's actually, there's one story\nthat just makes me giggle when I think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2581160,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about it. Like, I'm so happy that I'm at\nthis point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2583480,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a few weeks ago, I ran two cohorts of\ncontinuous interviewing in July, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2588360,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means I was getting way more traces than I\nhad ever had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2591220,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And after week one, I started to see a new\nerror."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2594540,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the error was excerpts would get\nrepeated across dimensions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2600120,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like, in the opening with the\nstory-based, or in setting the scene, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2603340,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coach would be like, this is a great\nsetting the scene question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2605960,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then in building the timeline, it\nwould be the exact same excerpt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2609280,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it would be like, this is a terrible\nbuilding the timeline question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2612720,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really confusing for students."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2614720,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's one of the first times I saw an\nerror mode that, like, spanned LLM calls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2620880,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so at first I was like, oh, how am I\ngoing to fix this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2623880,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And my first idea was like, I need a\nquestion classifier, and then I'll only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2628020,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "send each dimension the questions that are\nrelevant to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2630520,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I spent like a day and a half working\non a question classifier, which sucks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2633920,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, it's so ambiguous and so hard, and I\ndon't have lots of questions, and, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2637920,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was just getting gnarly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2639880,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I took a break, and I was at dinner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2641760,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was talking to my husband about it, and\nI was like, oh, what if I just sent any"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2647440,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "subsequent call the list of excerpts that\nwere already used and told it not to use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2652160,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2654580,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, I went from having an error mode\nthat showed up in 81% of transcripts to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2659360,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "having an error mode that only occurred in\n3% of transcripts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2662600,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what was super fun about this is that\nI didn't even know how to detect the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2666520,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "error, because the excerpts weren't\nexactly the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2669720,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So first I had to figure out, like, how do\nI write an eval that even detects this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2673600,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "error? And then I had to figure out, okay,\nthis isn't a prompt change."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2677860,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is actually a workflow change. So how\ndo I A/B test a workflow change?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2682800,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I had—and it all worked. And,\nlike, I did it all in three days."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2687740,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's when I was like, okay, I feel like\nan AI engineer now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2690740,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, you are definitely an AI engineer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2693320,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are in the very center of AI engineer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2696540,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is probably—you're like the example\nthat we need to show everybody as an AI"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2701640,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engineer, to be honest. I really love that\nyou're always measuring things before you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2706840,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do the improvement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2709280,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's so few people out there who\nactually take the effort and the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2714620,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "initiative to write the automated\nevaluator, or whatever it is, make sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2718640,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have measured 81%, then implement the\nfix, and then say 3%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2723240,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know. So much of this is because,\nlike, I just teach this exact same stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2728280,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a different domain, right? Like, in\ndiscovery, we talk about start with an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2733680,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "outcome. What are you trying to achieve?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2734860,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you don't know what that is and you\ncan't measure it, don't start changing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2738480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2739720,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there were so many analogies. Like,\neven Campbell's hammering on, look at your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2745020,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "data. My equivalent of that is go talk to\nyour customer, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2749240,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's just so many analogies that I\nthink I was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2754060,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really had a strong mental model to layer\nall"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2759960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this stuff onto."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2762680,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is a really good segue into this\nquestion of what do you think the product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2767960,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "manager and the engineer and whatever, how\nwill they work together?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2772040,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's very impressive, like, what you've\ndone, honestly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2774940,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, to synthesize this together, you've\ntaken a really good mindset this whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2779200,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing. Do you think it may collapse into?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2783860,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could a single person going to be doing\nthis going forward?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2786120,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you have an idea how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2788680,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you might teach product managers this, for\nexample?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2791820,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Will you teach them how to code a little\nbit?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2794140,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I'm just curious, like, what your\nthinking is on this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2797800,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I wish I had a good answer. I've\nbeen really thinking hard about this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2802280,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm a teacher by nature, and so I'm\nstarting to think about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2807160,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, product teams are clearly going to\nhave to do a lot of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2810520,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if they want it to be good, what does\nthat look like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2813800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Who is doing what? And I have some, like,\nhalf-baked ideas because I have been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2817700,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thinking about it a lot, but I don't have\na clear picture yet."
