  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2820960,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of my half-baked ideas is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2823240,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just separated my eval code from my data\nanalysis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2826640,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And part of the reason why I did that was,\nlike, to not reuse code, to be able to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2830840,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reuse code. But one of the benefits of\nthat is that, like, now someone can dig in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2836640,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and do data analysis without having to see\nthe code."
