  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2878540,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this is a new skill that we're all\ngoing to have to learn around,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2884020,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "okay, I wanted to create an interview\ncoach."
