  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2886380,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I had no idea how to do it on day one, but\nI just took a first step and I tried"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2891220,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something. And then I got stuck, and I\nlearned how to use an LLM to get unstuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2895580,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I followed that pattern, like,\n4,000 times over the last four months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2899800,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think it's this skill of, like, how\ndo you identify the smallest piece that"
    } ]
