  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3037780,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but, like, I was really bad at programming\nbecause I didn't know how to get unstuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3042180,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whereas, like, now LLMs, like, they\ndon't—you can ask a really dumb question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3047200,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they don't care. So I just, I think\nwhen you're in a conversational flow, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3052740,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when you're in the web app of Claude AI or\nChatGPT.com, like prompt engineering does"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3058480,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not matter because you can iterate, right?"
