  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3072440,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so some of it is just patience to pick\nthrough it and know that you can figure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3076920,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it out with enough time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3078880,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went through this past week. So we're\nlike at the 11th hour about to release the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3083680,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interview coach inside Vistaly,"
