  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3096320,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the test failed, and there was an uncaught\nerror."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3099100,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, wow, I've been beating up\nmy error handling."
