  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3116640,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I had written my sub step functions to\nreturn an error in the payload."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3122580,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, you can't do that. Like, it has\nto throw an exception for the parent step"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3126520,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "function to call it. So I realized, like,\nat the 11th hour, all of my error handling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3130380,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "between my step function to step function\ncalls were wrong."
