  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3133720,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, if you didn't understand all of\nthat, any of that, all you have to know is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3137440,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this was a very embarrassing\nlast-minute thing that made me realize my"
