  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3270040,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, unfortunately, there's only two\nways to try this right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3275160,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is through our continuous, excuse me,\nour continuous interviewing course"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3279660,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or through Vistaly. So if you're looking\nfor a product discovery tool, I do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3284000,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strongly recommend Vistaly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3287020,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I am starting to think through what's\na light version of the coach that I can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3292660,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make freely available. And actually, it's\nbased on those very two evals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3296640,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can I at least give people feedback for\nfree on, did they ask leading questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3300580,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and general questions? So I'll have more\nthat's, like, publicly available to, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3305460,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least play with probably in the next\ncouple weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3309780,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's great. And what's the best way for\npeople to follow you or keep up with what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3313300,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're doing? What do you recommend that\npeople do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3316240,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, so I blog at producttalk.org."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3320420,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm on LinkedIn and X."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3323340,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LinkedIn lately has been my primary social\nnetwork, but I do check in on X every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3328460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3330160,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's probably the best places. And then\nI'll be in the Discord, so if there's lots"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3333600,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of questions, I'm happy—if we have time,\nI'm happy to take questions now, and I'm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3337060,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also happy to take questions in the\nDiscord."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3339560,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, yeah, we could take some questions\nnow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3341800,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you have a little bit of time, Teresa?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3343120,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Okay. Robert has a good question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3346480,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you thinking about capturing\nannotations from end users directly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3351140,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is that something that you've thought\nabout, or do you feel like, I am the PM,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3356020,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or I'm, like, building this product and I\nwant to control all the annotation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3359700,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, Robert, we actually had a Twitter\ndiscussion about this, and I forgot I was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3363900,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to tackle this. One of the things\nI'm really excited about is, what's the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3369280,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "customer feedback loop in all of this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3370700,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because that's my jam. And there's a few\nplaces of things in the class that I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3375080,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learned that I really want to experiment\nwith."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3377180,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one is— You guys learn to generate\nsynthetic data by defining, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3381300,
    "dDurationMs": 2896,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dimensions. I actually think those\ndimensions should come"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3384196,
    "dDurationMs": 2416,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from customer needs and customer pain\npoints."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3386612,
    "dDurationMs": 3936,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like, the recipe bot, like if you've\ntalked to people about how they plan their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3390548,
    "dDurationMs": 3776,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meals and you know what their use cases\nare, like it gives you way better input"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3394324,
    "dDurationMs": 3736,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for what those dimensions should be and,\nlike, what types of variations you're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3398060,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to have ahead of time. That's a\nreally clear area where I can see a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3402020,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "connection between traditional discovery\nwork and, like, the very beginning phases"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3406380,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of, like, how do we generate\nrepresentative synthetic data."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3412140,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another area is, like, almost every AI\nproduct has, like, a thumbs up, thumbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3416860,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down, was this helpful? And, like, I did\nbuild that into the interview coach in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3420720,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Vistaly. I'm still trying to figure out\nhow to do it in our course because they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3423440,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get it by email."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3427620,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I would love it if we could find—I\nwant to really experiment with UX"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3433320,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "patterns of, like, how can we get the\ncustomer to communicate more granular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3438080,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "error feedback? So if they're giving me\nfeedback on the whole response, this was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3442000,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "helpful or not, that's great. It, like, it\ntells me to go investigate that trace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3446720,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If they give me a verbatim of why, that's\neven more helpful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3449420,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I would love to get to the point of,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3452160,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no, this excerpt, the tip on this excerpt\nis wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3457040,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or—and just, like, what—like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3459940,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ultimately our product works if it works\nfor the customer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3462920,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so as a product manager, you can be a\nproxy for that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3466380,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is there a way—I'm always looking for,\nlike, how do we get the customer closer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3472200,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the problem?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3474500,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't, Robert, I don't have answers for\nyou yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3476800,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I've been so heads down building,\ngetting ready for this Vistaly beta that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3481040,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've just been an engineer. But I'm going\nto put my product management, product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3484260,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discovery hat back on and start to run\nsome of those experiments too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3491540,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have some background in computer\nscience education."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3494980,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You did some JavaScript development early\nin your career."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3498300,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you think you would have been just as\nsuccessful without that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3503320,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3504640,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "looking at this talk, should they feel\nlike they can do what you did without that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3508540,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "education?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3512060,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Okay, so for like decades, there's\nbeen this debate in the product management"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3516660,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "world about should product managers learn\nhow to code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3520380,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm really glad I learned how to code\nin college."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3524860,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I a little bit, even as a kid, I coded in\nBASIC on an Apple IIe, but like I really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3530080,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learned how to code in college. I, because\none of the skills I got from learning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3536060,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how to code is this like problem solving,\ndebugging,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3539860,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "deconstructing like a big problem into\nsmaller parts, and then also like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3543940,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "attention to detail that I don't think you\nget in anything else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3547480,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I think there's skills you learn\nfrom coding that transfer to other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3552100,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "domains, and I think coding is one of the\nbest ways to learn those skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3556700,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there's part of me that like everybody,\nI think maybe coding,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3560860,
    "dDurationMs": 1580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even with vibe coding being a thing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3563220,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "might be a proficiency like literacy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3565680,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just feel like it teaches such good\nproblem-solving skills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3571700,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could I have done this if I didn't have\nthat background?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3575180,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Okay, so my undergraduate was symbolic\nsystems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3578000,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for people that are familiar with this\nat Stanford, it's a cross-disciplinary,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3582800,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a multidisciplinary program. It\nfocuses on how humans and machines process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3587440,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "information. It's also what's happening in\nthe world with generative AI is so cool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3592320,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the context of symbolic systems. And I\nhad to take classes from computer science."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3599020,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The analytical side of linguistics, so\nlike the underlying structure of language,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3603900,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "analytical philosophy, so like mind-brain\nphilosophy, and then cognitive psychology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3609160,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's really like, how do we understand\nthe information processing from four"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3613040,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different domains?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3614760,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What I really took away from that program\nwas critical thinking and problem solving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3619620,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like, ideally this is what every\nprogram is teaching, but I think when you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3623380,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see how four different domains solve very\nsimilar problems, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3629340,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "start to see this pattern. For me anyway,\nI started to see this pattern that I would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3633820,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "call a more like problem-solving critical\nthinking pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3637840,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I think I could do this. I think\nthat experience helped me be good at these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3642800,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "types of things. Like I think what I was\ngood at in this whole process was just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3646820,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like the critical thinking part of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3651100,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is coding the only way to learn critical\nthinking?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3654040,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm sure there's plenty of people\nlistening right now that are good critical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3657540,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thinkers and good problem solvers and have\nnever written a line of code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3661160,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think it's a really good way to\nlearn it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3665980,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And do you think, and this may be hard to\npredict, and I've asked this before, but I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3669620,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just want to revisit it. If you were to\nteach, try to teach this to product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3673900,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "managers, is your sense, do you maybe\nintroduce some code or teach them how to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3679320,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "code, since you do think it's one of the\nbest, you mentioned AI is like the best"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3682960,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing, or would you try to go at it a\ndifferent way or you haven't decided yet?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3687540,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is actually a genuinely hard problem\nfor me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3690760,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm trying to decide what I can uniquely\noffer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3695000,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So like the AI race right now is insane."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3698860,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like Aman Khan is doing really cool work\nin his last cohort of his Maven class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3703480,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He had 30 people using, like non-technical\npeople using Cursor, which is awesome,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3708220,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right? Is that the right path? I don't\nknow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3711080,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think right now, is it going to be the\nright path in the long run?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3716200,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I'm working out of a notebook, and I\nlove notebooks, but notebooks are pretty"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3719440,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "technical. Am I really going to teach all\nmy instructors how to set up a development"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3723300,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "environment on their Mac? And if they're\non Windows, I can't help them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3726660,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, there's some real challenges with\nthe way that I'm working for transferring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3732300,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it to other people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3734180,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, like, in some ways, I wish I was\nstill on a cross-functional team because,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3739140,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, I kind of want to partner with the\nengineer and play with some of these ideas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3743080,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what do those handoffs look like."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3745380,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One thing I am going to do, I'll give you\nguys all a sneak peek."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3747920,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm in the process—okay, I'm in the\nprocess of recording some podcast"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3751680,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "episodes. I'm going to be launching a new\npodcast in September, and I'm interviewing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3756520,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cross-functional product teams about how\nthey're building their AI products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3760600,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's not the, like, How I AI, Clairvo\npodcast and how people are using AI in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3765780,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their day-to-day workflows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3767440,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's, here's the story—it's what I did\ntoday."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3770280,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's the story of an AI product. Here's\nhow it came to fruition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3773600,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what I'm really interested in covering\nin those stories is who did what and how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3778040,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do we collaborate? Because I think this is\na really open question, and I'm not sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3782840,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what to teach yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3784720,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I do want to help. Like, I do, as an\neducator, I will be doing something in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3788780,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this space. I'm just still figuring out\nwhat the right something is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3793440,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would love to see a visual map of how\nyou went about annotation to the app that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3799300,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're building. Specifically, there's\nprobably a lot of micro decisions that you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3803980,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had to make along the way, and so could\nyou unravel some of those?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3808740,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were they difficult to make? How did you\nknow whether something was, like, a micro"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3812600,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decision or something that, like, required\nmore, like you learning something new or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3816860,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "figuring out something new?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3819280,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I can talk about some of the kind of\nkey decision points I made and how they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3822900,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "came about, and maybe that'll illustrate\nthis a little bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3826000,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Like, one of the big ones was I\nstarted—the interview coach was one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3829620,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prompt. Like it was this monster prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3832480,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the problem I saw with that was that\nin the coaching responses, like one of my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3837160,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "biggest failure modes was the coach would\ngive feedback on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3843080,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one dimension, but use criteria from a\ndifferent dimension."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3847200,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was confusing the rules across\ndimensions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3853000,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think like around that time, I\nlearned about workflows, and I was like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3857320,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "oh, maybe this needs to be a series of LLM\ncalls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3860440,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I broke it up into four LLM calls."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3864120,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then that introduced some new\nproblems, like now, like setting this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3869260,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's that too much setting the scene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3870660,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like setting the scene doesn't know about\nbuilding the timeline, and it's literally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3873880,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluating the entire interview based on\nsetting the scene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3877620,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3879380,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "change had a really big impact. Like my\noverall quality went up when I split up my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3884520,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LLM calls, but my, it introduced new error\nmodes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3888880,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is something that like I think is\nprobably really common."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3892460,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There isn't a magical change that makes\neverything better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3895520,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like a change can improve some things\nand then maybe introduce some new errors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3900580,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3903860,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then started, well, I had four LLM calls,\nthen I really got stuck on,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3909180,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I even asked this in the Discord, do I do\nevals for each LLM call or do I do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3915140,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evals for the whole response? And I\nactually started by doing them one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3919560,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dimension at a time, and it got really\noverwhelming because I was just like, I'm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3924340,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to be doing evals for the rest of my\nlife."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3926380,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I realized like by doing it one\ndimension at a time, I was like finding a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3930880,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lot of errors, but a lot of them weren't\ncritical errors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3934560,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so then I was like, oh, maybe I\nactually should do evals on the whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3937900,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3939420,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I should do analysis annotations on the\nwhole trace, because then I can still find"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3944140,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dimension-specific errors, but I'm\nprioritizing all of them against each"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3947580,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other. And that actually made a really big\ndifference."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3950380,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I still do individual dimension\nannotations when I'm working on an eval"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3956160,
    "dDurationMs": 5300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's specific to that dimension. But I'm\ndoing my error analysis and, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3961460,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "failure mode prioritization on the whole\ntrace, because that's, like, what's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3965060,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "impacting my customer. And that was a\npattern I really struggled with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3968840,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's the right way to do this? And I've\ntried both."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3971760,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've spent a ton of time annotating things\nI didn't need to annotate as a result."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3976440,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I just, I think, for me, my conclusion\nis I should start with the customer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3982180,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experience. The customer gets the full\ntrace."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3984720,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going to look at the whole trace, and\nit helps me prioritize a little bit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3987960,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better. So that was a key decision point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3994680,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Choosing to move from Airtable interfaces\nto my own annotation tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3999580,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, I know in class we learned build\nyour own annotation tool, and I was like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4002660,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I did, in Airtable. But, like, really\nbuilding my own annotation tool, like I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4007840,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still, I'll be annotating, I'll be like\nfour traces in, and I'll be like, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4012660,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even this morning I was annotating\nactually right before this, and I was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4015960,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, why didn't I add, like, little pills\nabove my failure mode so, like, in this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4021360,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "set, once I've used an error mode, it\nshould just be a pill so I don't have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4024900,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go back and remember what the stupid\nfailure mode was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4027880,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like, I'm constantly thinking of ways\nto make annotating faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4031300,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I literally just stop what I'm doing\nand I'm like, Claude, can you add this to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4034720,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this annotation tool? And I'm forcing\nmyself to do that because, like you learn"
