  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4039040,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this class,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4040580,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like annotation is so important, and if\nit's not effortless and fast, like you're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4045780,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just not going to do enough of it. And my\nannotations are hard."
