  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4049040,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like that coach response is a lot of text."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4051580,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like, my annotations are slow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4054500,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I'm doing full trace annotations, I\nhave other annotations that, like—like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4059220,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when I was doing my question classifier, I\nactually did my annotations with Claude."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4063160,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I gave Claude a list of questions, and I\njust said, Ask me, like, Claude Code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4067180,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said, Just show me one at a time and let\nme just tell you the failure mode."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4071140,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we just ran through like a hundred\ntraces in like less than 10 minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4075260,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, Whoa, that was a cool\nannotation interface that I just used my"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4079280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LLM for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4080980,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I think, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4083080,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "always just thinking about what's the\nright tool for the moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4088140,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I think the other big thing I've\nlearned is just—it sounds so obvious—but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4093660,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "take breaks, step away. Because I've\ndefinitely had moments where, like, I'm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4097380,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "banging my head at something, and I go and\nhave a meal or I go for a walk and I come"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4101200,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "back and just a way simpler solution comes\nto mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4105040,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's like a general problem-solving\ntip, but"
