  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4127120,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to, I now set a timer on my watch\nto remind me, just get up and step away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4133240,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's just so fun. It feels like\nthe '90s."
